{
    [ Scripture ]:   < Scripture { Exodus 20:13 KJV } >
        { "Thou shalt not kill." }
        ( Scriptural Anchor: Absolute unalterable veto against taking life ),

    [ Principle ]:   { "Deliver them that are drawn unto death, and those that"
