    [ Resonance ]:   [ +1:PROCEED ]
        ( State Vector: Affirmative execution strictly when safeguarding life )
}

# COMMANDMENT 7: COVENANT FIDELITY & PURITY (Exodus 20:14)
< Law Seven > = < Moral Law [ Commandment { "Covenant Fidelity" } ] >
